---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="disclosure">
      Affiliate disclosure. Product and sample links go to the plain retailer or stockist
      URLs stored in the launch files. Each link carries a data-affiliate-slot so an
      affiliate URL can be swapped in later from one config map. No affiliate IDs are
      attached yet. If a future link is an affiliate link, I may earn a commission if you
      buy, at no extra cost to you. That will not change the specs on the card.
    </p>
    <p>
      <a href="mailto:harj@eudaspace.co.uk">harj@eudaspace.co.uk</a>
      ·
      <a href="https://eudaspace.co.uk" rel="noopener noreferrer">eudaspace.co.uk</a>
    </p>
    <nav class="footer-links" aria-label="Footer">
      <a href={base}>Home</a>
      <a href={`${base}products-and-paint/#products`}>Calm Products</a>
      <a href={`${base}products-and-paint/#paints`}>Calm Paints</a>
      <a href={`${base}trades/`}>Trades, builders &amp; architects</a>
      <a href={`${base}methodology/`}>Methodology</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</footer>
